        whyQ: '¿Por qué aplaudió la gente?', whyQEn: 'Why did people clap?',
        tfT: 'En el mercado de trueque no se usaba dinero.', tfTEn: 'No money was used at the swap market.', tfF: 'Era el quinto mercado de trueque del valle.', tfFEn: 'It was the valley’s fifth swap market.', tfN: 'La bicicleta era roja.', tfNEn: 'The bicycle was red.',
